#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0278-A expect=noViolation domain=TS
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when a record exists with TSPARMCD equal to 'STYPE' and TSVAL equal to 'INTERVENTIONAL', but no record with TSPARMCD equal to 'INTTYPE' is present in TS.
#note "The gate is not satisfied (STYPE=OBSERVATIONAL), so the rule cannot fire even though INTTYPE is absent."
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S01 | TS | 1 | STYPE | OBSERVATIONAL
S01 | TS | 2 | TITLE | A Study of Drug X
---
